,-0.02360354,0.00762095,-0.12637824,0.02839084,0.03287652,0.15869343,-0.08755562,-0.00947243,0.09071658,-0.02180278,0.01623029,-0.02385525,0.00843203,0.00956606,0.03822538,0.06499723,0.04056055,0.02334141,0.01888306,-0.03183856,-0.0019241,-0.00347802,-0.0065366,0.04522068,0.00884696,-0.03706261,-0.00074026,0.07034162,-0.03987354,-0.01311793,-0.03847338,0.01735598,0.01630419,0.01160066,-0.01847065,0.00744618,0.03762742,0.03811388,-0.00430318,0.01802511,-0.04329684,-0.03011337,-0.04525999,0.03998471,0.03597491,-0.0419829,0.07106156,-0.00162092],"last_embed":{"hash":"18fel70","tokens":415}}},"last_read":{"hash":"18fel70","at":1778067900901},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1774939523000,"size":4302,"at":1778067900901,"hash":"18fel70"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#Are Digital Health Technologies and Models of Nutrition Care the Future of Chronic Kidney Disease Management?":[20,42],"#Are Digital Health Technologies and Models of Nutrition Care the Future of Chronic Kidney Disease Management?#{1}":[21,25],"#Are Digital Health Technologies and Models of Nutrition Care the Future of Chronic Kidney Disease Management?#📝 Benim Notlarım":[26,28],"#Are Digital Health Technologies and Models of Nutrition Care the Future of Chronic Kidney Disease Management?#🟡 Genel Bilgiler (Sarı)":[29,31],"#Are Digital Health Technologies and Models of Nutrition Care the Future of Chronic Kidney Disease Management?#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[32,34],"#Are Digital Health Technologies and Models of Nutrition Care the Future of Chronic Kidney Disease Management?#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[33,34],"#Are Digital Health Technologies and Models of Nutrition Care the Future of Chronic Kidney Disease Management?#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[35,37],"#Are Digital Health Technologies and Models of Nutrition Care the Future of Chronic Kidney Disease Management?#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[36,37],"#Are Digital Health Technologies and Models of Nutrition Care the Future of Chronic Kidney Disease Management?#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#Are Digital Health Technologies and Models of Nutrition Care the Future of Chronic Kidney Disease Management?#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/HDGW5GKI","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/QMQ8LTPC?page=1&annotation=J4BTEWJJ","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/QMQ8LTPC?page=1&annotation=58EVC8NR","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 7","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/QMQ8LTPC?page=7&annotation=6MSM3JK2","line":36}],"metadata":{"Title":"Are Digital Health Technologies and Models of Nutrition Care the Future of Chronic Kidney Disease Management?","Authors":"Jaimon T. Kelly, Dev K. Jegatheesan, Jessica Dawson, Amandine Barnett, Ban-Hock Khor, Alex R. Chang, Juan-Jesus Carrero, Katrina L. Campbell","Year":2023,"DOI":"10.1053/j.jrn.2023.02.004","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"This paper overviews the current evidence base concerning the past and present mobile and digital health programs to improve nutrition in CKD and highlights the novel future trends in this field","Findings":"Of the available evidence to date, these modalities appear to improve dietary sodium intake and diet quality, self-efficacy, interdialytic weight gain, and body weight. Many barriers exist to sustaining the continued and widespread adoption of digital and mobile health-supported nutrition care in CKD. These include patient-, clinician-, and health system-specific and are discussed in detail. Mobile and digital-supported models of nutrition care present an exciting opportunity to assist kidney dietitians deliver patient-centred nutrition care in CKThough virtual nutrition care has now become standard practice across much of clinical practice, present mHealth readiness, practices, and policies are not ready to fully augment and support routine nutrition care practice in nephrology.  Improved efficiency and convenience will likely continue to appeal and drive the demand for more investment and integration of mHealth-supported nutrition care in nephrology: for patients, caregivers, and clinicians alike, as it presents the opportunity to deliver quality health care in a more time and cost-efficient manner. mHealthsupported models of nutrition care present an exciting opportunity to support dietitians deliver patient-centred nutrition care to people living with kidney disease.","Conclusions":"","Limitations":"","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"18fel70","at":1774939754938},"key":"Augmented Dietitian/kellyAreDigitalHealth2023.md"},
